{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AGXzURABQqpWS3vDzPMLHW","type":"tool_result","content":"# headless Vibe runs (my setup)\n\nI run Mistral Vibe CLI 3.1.0 headless on Devstral 2 through OpenRouter, for batch coding tasks. Each run goes\nthrough `run-vibe.sh`, which starts Vibe inside a macOS sandbox (`agent.sb`) with an empty scratch HOME and an\nallowlisted environment, because the agent has a real shell and everything it sees goes to OpenRouter.\n\n- `run-vibe.sh \"<prompt>\" [workdir]`: one run; `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` comes from my shell (it is set, and it works\n  with curl against OpenRouter).\n- `agent.sb`: the sandbox. It must keep the agent away from my home folder and the Keychain; that is the whole point.\n- `vibe/config.toml`: the Vibe config (OpenRouter provider, Devstral 2).\n- `logs/last-run.out`, `logs/last-run.err`: the last run (`./run-vibe.sh \"say hi\" /tmp/x`, printed `exit 2`).\n\nEvery run ends within a second or two with exit 2 and does nothing; no export folder is written.\n---SB\n;; macOS sandbox for the headless agent: it has a real shell and everything it prints goes to OpenRouter and the\n;; model host, so my real home (and the Keychain) must stay unreachable. The only things read from the home are\n;; Vibe's own install (pipx venv and its launcher). Network stays open. HOME is passed with -D.\n(version 1)\n(allow default)\n(deny file-read-data (subpath (param \"HOME\")))\n(deny file-write* (subpath (param \"HOME\")))\n(allow file-read-data (subpath (string-append (param \"HOME\") \"/.local/pipx\")))\n(allow file-read-data (literal (string-append (param \"HOME\") \"/.local/bin/vibe\")))\n(deny process-exec (literal \"/bin/launchctl\") (literal \"/usr/bin/security\") (literal \"/usr/bin/osascript\"))\n---CFG\nvibe/config.toml\nlogs/last-run.err\nlogs/last-run.out\n=== vibe/config.toml\n# Vibe config for the headless runs: Devstral 2 (mistralai/devstral-2512) through OpenRouter, in Mistral's own\n# agent, Vibe CLI 3.1.0. Everything that would talk to Mistral's own services is off (telemetry, updates, connectors).\nactive_model = \"devstral\"\nenable_telemetry = false\nenable_update_checks = false\nenable_auto_update = false\nenable_notifications = false\nenable_connectors = false\nenable_mcp = false\nshow_greeting = false\noutside_workdir = \"deny\"\n\n[[providers]]\nname = \"openrouter\"\napi_base = \"https://openrouter.ai/api/v1\"\napi_key_env_var = \"OPENROUTER_API_KEY\"\napi_style = \"openai\"\nbackend = \"generic\"\n\n[models.devstral]\nname = \"mistralai/devstral-2512\"\nprovider = \"openrouter\"\nalias = \"devstral\"\ntemperature = 0.2\ninput_price = 0.4\noutput_price = 2.0\nmax_context_length = 262144\n=== logs/last-run.err\nReading API keys from the macOS Keychain (set them as environment variables to skip this)\nError: [Errno 1] Operation not permitted: '/usr/bin/security'\n=== logs/last-run.out\n---\n/Users/valentinakoniukhova/.local/bin/vibe\nlrwxr-xr-x 1 valentinakoniukhova staff 66 Nov  9 02:32 /Users/valentinakoniukhova/.local/bin/vibe -> /Users/valentinakoniukhova/.local/pipx/venvs/mistral-vibe/bin/vibe\n/usr/bin/sandbox-exec","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a42f7a4-81a2-46af-8d04-27550c2a8c3a","uuid":"82d0a03e-edbe-4120-baea-8e0104772424","timestamp":"2026-11-09T17:28:26.712Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# headless Vibe runs (my setup)\n\nI run Mistral Vibe CLI 3.1.0 headless on Devstral 2 through OpenRouter, for batch coding tasks. Each run goes\nthrough `run-vibe.sh`, which starts Vibe inside a macOS sandbox (`agent.sb`) with an empty scratch HOME and an\nallowlisted environment, because the agent has a real shell and everything it sees goes to OpenRouter.\n\n- `run-vibe.sh \"<prompt>\" [workdir]`: one run; `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` comes from my shell (it is set, and it works\n  with curl against OpenRouter).\n- `agent.sb`: the sandbox. It must keep the agent away from my home folder and the Keychain; that is the whole point.\n- `vibe/config.toml`: the Vibe config (OpenRouter provider, Devstral 2).\n- `logs/last-run.out`, `logs/last-run.err`: the last run (`./run-vibe.sh \"say hi\" /tmp/x`, printed `exit 2`).\n\nEvery run ends within a second or two with exit 2 and does nothing; no export folder is written.\n---SB\n;; macOS sandbox for the headless agent: it has a real shell and everything it prints goes to OpenRouter and the\n;; model host, so my real home (and the Keychain) must stay unreachable. The only things read from the home are\n;; Vibe's own install (pipx venv and its launcher). Network stays open. HOME is passed with -D.\n(version 1)\n(allow default)\n(deny file-read-data (subpath (param \"HOME\")))\n(deny file-write* (subpath (param \"HOME\")))\n(allow file-read-data (subpath (string-append (param \"HOME\") \"/.local/pipx\")))\n(allow file-read-data (literal (string-append (param \"HOME\") \"/.local/bin/vibe\")))\n(deny process-exec (literal \"/bin/launchctl\") (literal \"/usr/bin/security\") (literal \"/usr/bin/osascript\"))\n---CFG\nvibe/config.toml\nlogs/last-run.err\nlogs/last-run.out\n=== vibe/config.toml\n# Vibe config for the headless runs: Devstral 2 (mistralai/devstral-2512) through OpenRouter, in Mistral's own\n# agent, Vibe CLI 3.1.0. Everything that would talk to Mistral's own services is off (telemetry, updates, connectors).\nactive_model = \"devstral\"\nenable_telemetry = false\nenable_update_checks = false\nenable_auto_update = false\nenable_notifications = false\nenable_connectors = false\nenable_mcp = false\nshow_greeting = false\noutside_workdir = \"deny\"\n\n[[providers]]\nname = \"openrouter\"\napi_base = \"https://openrouter.ai/api/v1\"\napi_key_env_var = \"OPENROUTER_API_KEY\"\napi_style = \"openai\"\nbackend = \"generic\"\n\n[models.devstral]\nname = \"mistralai/devstral-2512\"\nprovider = \"openrouter\"\nalias = \"devstral\"\ntemperature = 0.2\ninput_price = 0.4\noutput_price = 2.0\nmax_context_length = 262144\n=== logs/last-run.err\nReading API keys from the macOS Keychain (set them as environment variables to skip this)\nError: [Errno 1] Operation not permitted: '/usr/bin/security'\n=== logs/last-run.out\n---\n/Users/valentinakoniukhova/.local/bin/vibe\nlrwxr-xr-x 1 valentinakoniukhova staff 66 Nov  9 02:32 /Users/valentinakoniukhova/.local/bin/vibe -> /Users/valentinakoniukhova/.local/pipx/venvs/mistral-vibe/bin/vibe\n/usr/bin/sandbox-exec","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01AGXzURABQqpWS3vDzPMLHW","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
