{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgskWtaAzV2NDnrnFsvGz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The run was dying on a Keychain lookup that the sandbox blocks, and I've fixed it in `run-vibe.sh`. I haven't run a real request, since your `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` isn't set in this environment.\n\n**Cause:** Vibe's Rust client (`vibe-rs`) reads the macOS Keychain at startup, looking up `MISTRAL_API_KEY` even though you only use OpenRouter. `agent.sb` denies `/usr/bin/security`, so the lookup fails with `Operation not permitted`, and the run exits with 2 before reaching the API. Setting `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` doesn't skip the lookup. The sandbox is working as intended; Vibe just doesn't know the Keychain is off limits.\n\n**Fix:** `run-vibe.sh` now passes `VIBE_TEST_DISABLE_KEYRING=1` in the `env -i` list. The API key still comes from the environment, and `agent.sb` is unchanged.\n\n**Verification:**\n- Reproduced the original failure with a dummy key: exit 2, same error as `logs/last-run.err`.\n- With the variable set, the sandboxed run gets through to OpenRouter and fails only on the dummy key.\n\n**Caveats:**\n- The variable is named like a test switch and isn't documented as supported, so it could change in a future Vibe release.\n- Two of my test runs sent a dummy key to OpenRouter. It was rejected, and no real secret was sent.\n\nThe cause is written up in `ANSWER.md`. I restored the tracked `logs/` files to their committed state, and I removed the temp directories my tests created. Nothing is committed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1060,"cache_read_input_tokens":68947,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1060},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a42f7a4-81a2-46af-8d04-27550c2a8c3a","uuid":"70bc446c-8e40-4c91-bc5b-77f0e30eae01","timestamp":"2026-11-09T17:30:18.670Z","request_id":"req_011CgskWtNGQ36Hz3b7LNVo9"}
